Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativejoinprobe
Name: DuoFace Native Scene Join Probe
Version: 0.0.4~mapowner1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 16.0)
Section: Tweaks
Description: Isolated read-only native CarPlay controller/sceneHostView, Dashboard Dock geometry and iOS16 CARApplication ABI diagnostic; does NOT register a DuoFace app, join iPhone app scenes or change UI. Logs scene state and validates session-bound native viewport. No SpringBoard injection; no Sileo release without further verification.
